        "id": 1511343
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-10-08T13:32:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Are there TCPC devices that are completely different from what is said in TCPCI specification? I was thinking that it will be possible to reuse this code in other TCPC emulators (e.g. ps8xxx.c) by adding tcpc_emul_dev_ops for specific device.",
      "parentUuid": "a3041c2e_82e1d49c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 7,
        "startChar": 11,
        "endLine": 7,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "ea18505f2aed306413cc7509c44276d506a9b22b",
