        "id": 1511343
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-10-11T13:14:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right now this code allows to setup chain of two messages. Pointer to the first one is data-\u003erx_msg. Pointer to the second message is data-\u003erx_msg-\u003enext. Maybe it is not reasonable to limit this to two messages, only because TCPCI specification says that TCPC has two buffers for messages. I will keep it as it is now and provide fix (if required) later when it will be needed (e.g. for emulating partner device).",
      "parentUuid": "2e77c53e_fc91d43e",
      "revId": "ea18505f2aed306413cc7509c44276d506a9b22b",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
