      "writtenOn": "2021-10-07T22:49:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am not sure this is what our TCPCs would do if we double-read RECEIVE_BUFFER. I think they might just give back the same message contents again. Looking at FAULT_STATUS, I don\u0027t see that this would trigger an I2C Interface Error. Does it describe this behavior somewhere else in the spec?",
      "revId": "ea18505f2aed306413cc7509c44276d506a9b22b",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
