      "writtenOn": "2021-10-08T13:32:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You are right that when there is no message in buffer, then TCPC shouldn\u0027t fail on RECEIVE_BUFFER. Instead it should return 0 for READABLE_BYTE_COUNT. Message is always cleared when alert RX message (bit 2) is cleared. To start reading message from the beginning, ResetReceiveBuffer command should be send.\n\nI will fix this part of the emulator",
      "parentUuid": "7b3528be_94b4c4a0",
